  "body": "Room to grow, space to gather and the beach just moments away. Offering an impressive 264m2 (mol) of floor area, this spacious home at 28 Headsail Drive features five bedrooms, three and a half bathrooms and two separate living areas, creating plenty of room for families of all ages. Set on a generous 552m2 (mol) section, there's space for everyone, from teenagers to grandparents, to enjoy their own comfort and privacy.\r\n\r\nParking is well catered for, with a double garage, covered carport parking for two vehicles and additional uncovered space for another two. Whether it's a large family, visiting guests or extra vehicles and recreational toys, there's room to accommodate them all.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the coastal lifestyle. Long Bay Regional Park is just minutes away, offering a beautiful stretch of sandy beach, marine reserve waters and scenic coastal walks. Long Bay Primary and Long Bay College are nearby, while Torbay shops and Browns Bay cafes are just a short drive away. Westfield Albany and a wide range of surrounding amenities take care of your shopping needs, with the city approximately 30 minutes away.\r\n\r\nSpacious, modern and perfectly positioned in one of the North Shore's most cherished coastal communities, this is a home where family living and beachside enjoyment come naturally.\r\n\r\nOther agents: conjunctionals welcome\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale: Wednesday 16 December at 4:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n*Property particulars have been obtained by a third party.",
